##!
# @file
#
# @created parth 20250324

# ----------------------------------------------------------
# Transition: SSQ = low & sortasickening headset
# Two outcomes: 
#   - Transition to medium (prob = 0.9)
#   - Stay at low (prob = 0.1)
# Use log-probs as numeric preferences for softmax behavior
# ----------------------------------------------------------
# When the headset is in the sortasickening range (h ∈ [1..5]), Soar will:

# Propose two operators: ssq-low-to-med and ssq-stay-low

# Each with a numeric preference based on the precomputed log-probability

# Soar will resolve the decision stochastically, preferring the higher log-prob, but allowing the lower one occasionally (like PRISM)

# === Propose transition to medium ===
sp {propose*ssq-low-to-med
    (state <s>
        ^ssq low
        ^gender female
        ^headset.h <h>
        ^log-l2mprob <logmed>)
    (<h> >= 1)
    (<h> <= 5)
-->
    (<s> ^operator <o> + = <logmed>) # ~ log(0.9)
    (<o> ^name ssq-low-to-med)    
}

# === Propose to stay in low ===
sp {propose*ssq-stay-low
    (state <s>
        ^ssq low
        ^gender female
        ^headset.h <h>
        ^log-stay-low <logstay>)
    (<h> >= 1)
    (<h> <= 5)
-->
    (<s> ^operator <o> + = <logstay>) # ~ log(0.1)
    (<o> ^name ssq-stay-low)    
}

